            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Verna"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I lived in Maine for my first 22 years, and this is almost exactly the recipe my Grandfather made every weekend during lobster season! He usually used milk and a can of evaporated milk, which tastes pretty close to half-and-half but has less fat. Yummmmm!",
            "datePublished": "2005-01-19T23:09:32.670Z"
          },
